{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_4_level_main_04-08_beg","groupId":"main_4","stageId":"main_04-08","title":"应激反应","storyCode":"4-8","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_04-08_beg.txt","sourceHash":"be6e88616e3be3f64c33224310a0495bf96f3ba638313529bde9db41ea88280d","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第三十二关（前）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"这里是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我们已经很接近霜叶给出的坐标了，但......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"这股味道有些恶心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"难道是焦臭味......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"整合运动把我们引到了什么地方？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啧！小心偷袭！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"可恶！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动术师","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"没，没打中吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系，我们这里是安全的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动术师","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"你，你怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动术师","speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","isRemote":false,"text":"咕，咕......啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"他没机会回答你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"什，什么！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"是在那座建筑里吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"等等......那个难道是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"霜叶！霜叶，是你吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"是我。敌人我解决掉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉让你担心了，阿米娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你受伤了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"医生，快来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......怎么会？你身上的，也是冻伤？你们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系，是小伤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"陨星和杰西卡还在广场那......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"暂时还不要紧，但继续拖下去就很难说了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"我把敌人引了出来，整合运动还没发现她们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"敌人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"我们现在的位置还比较隐蔽，不用太担心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"但他们马上就要来了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"小狐狸，你躲到那里去了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"快出来吧，捉迷藏要结束了哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"你每多藏一分钟，我就会折断你同伴一根手指——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"就算这样，你也还是要逃跑吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"（梅菲斯特——！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"（他在虚张声势。别激动。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"（他在做什么......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"整合运动转移了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"那个家伙......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我们需要先联系陨星她们——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我们明明已经跨过了污染地带，为什么通讯依然接不通？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"看看这个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"这是你的通讯器？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会结冰了？难道是被......冻坏了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"梅菲斯特只是个添头而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"这座废城里......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"徘徊着更可怕的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"可怕的东西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"雪怪们。撞上他们，事情就难办了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"雪怪，是说那个雪怪小队吗？他们究竟是......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"这点时间，很难讲的清。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"但整个区域的低温，以及各个小队的遭遇......都是这些家伙的杰作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"整合运动的这支队伍，似乎在废城中划下了自己的地盘呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"天色暗下来了，这是个好机会......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我们可以更加隐蔽的通过这片开阔地带。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，先去救出陨星她们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"我来带路。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"广场上这些......看不太清。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"是什么......雕塑吗？好奇怪的样子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"这股味道也令人作呕......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"这边，别走散了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"那些东西......别去看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"——有敌人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜叶","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"悄无声息的干掉吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米娅"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["整合运动成员"]},{"speakerId":"char_1011_wizard","aliases":["整合运动术师"]},{"speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","aliases":["梅菲斯特"]},{"speakerId":"char_193_frostl","aliases":["？？？","霜叶"]}]}
